You guys slipped into the basement, through the kitchen, and discovered a circle of cultists chanting before an idol of Procilmar. A brutal fight broke out. The cultists were slain pretty easily, and the statue was smashed, though not before its corrupted touch lashed out, searing anyone who laid a hand on it.

0:2:5.480 --> 0:2:22.280
