1:20:46.80 --> 1:21:1.40
Jeff Burke
So there's also half an owlbear rug on the ground somewhere too. Yeah, I think more importantly, from now on, when we refer to 911, it's the bag exploding that we're talking about.

1:20:50.400 --> 1:20:51.240
WHITRED, Peter
Bottom half, yeah.

1:20:52.560 --> 1:20:53.120
Jacob Featherstone
Yeah.

1:21:3.880 --> 1:21:9.320
Jacob Featherstone
What is the most significant element of 9/11?

1:21:5.160 --> 1:21:5.240
Phil Smith
So.

1:21:7.480 --> 1:21:7.640
Phil Smith
Uh.

1:21:10.440 --> 1:21:13.40
WHITRED, Peter
Remember the time the bag of holding exploded?

1:21:11.360 --> 1:21:24.520
Phil Smith
Yeah, that is the most significant thing I've ever heard of happening, and it's overshadowed all previous things that have happened on this day.

1:21:11.640 --> 1:21:16.360
Jacob Featherstone
Bag of holding exploding.

1:21:22.680 --> 1:21:22.800
Jeff Burke
OK.

